1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.544
Humans only spend money on three things, and three things only.

2
00:00:04.544 --> 00:00:06.312
The first is a solution.

3
00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:10.352
People will pay almost anything to make a problem disappear.

4
00:00:10.352 --> 00:00:12.119
Pain, stress, debt, loneliness.

5
00:00:12.119 --> 00:00:15.401
That's why people pay a doctor without blinking.

6
00:00:15.401 --> 00:00:17.170
The second is convenience.

7
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.452
The richest companies on earth are the most easiest.

8
00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:24.239
They just make something faster, simpler, less of a headache.

9
00:00:24.239 --> 00:00:28.667
People pay a premium their whole lives just to skip the hard way.

10
00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:31.620
And the third, my favorite, is an experience.

11
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:37.031
People will pay a stupid amount of money to feel something they can't get anywhere else.

12
00:00:37.031 --> 00:00:44.411
Starbucks charges lar five for cheap coffee because you're not paying for the coffee, you're paying for the feeling.

13
00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.380
That's the holiest solutions.

14
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.856
Convenience, experiences.

15
00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:51.299
Pick the one you'll be the best at, and the rest follow.
